---
import { clientList } from '@/constants/clients.constants';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import tesla from '@/assets/images/tesla.png';
---

<section class='bg-zinc-100'>
  <div class='container my-5 flex flex-col gap-4 py-8 sm:flex-row'>
    <div class='flex flex-grow items-center justify-center'>
      <Image
        src={tesla}
        alt='telsa logo'
        class='aspect-square size-64 object-contain object-center'
      />
    </div>
    <div class='flex flex-col justify-between gap-8'>
      <p class='max-w-[90ch] text-zinc-600'>
        Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Explicabo
        maiores esse et distinctio ut, accusamus quas ducimus qui unde ad
        delectus modi molestiae minus autem quis, eveniet aliquid reprehenderit
        rerum quaerat dolorem at. Atque adipisci animi sed doloremque earum
        veritatis magnam sapiente accusamus corporis rerum hic tempore facere
        nemo officiis cupiditate minima repellat libero, velit quos deserunt!
        Rerum ratione harum ad, vitae omnis ipsam quos vero consequatur neque
        cum natus voluptatum! Consectetur debitis laborum iusto ea ducimus quasi
        necessitatibus vitae iste quisquam vel magni id exercitationem
        dignissimos, nesciunt dolores velit!
      </p>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-1'>
        <span class='text-lg font-bold text-green-600'>Tim Smith</span>
        <span class='text-sm text-zinc-600'
          >British Dragon Boat Racing Association</span
        >
      </div>
      <div
        class='flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-10 sm:flex-row'
      >
        <div class='flex flex-grow justify-between gap-2'>
          {
            clientList
              .slice(0, 6)
              .map(({ alt, src }) => (
                <Image
                  class='aspect-square size-8 object-contain object-center'
                  src={src}
                  alt={alt}
                />
              ))
          }
        </div>
        <a href='/#' class='inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-green-600'>
          <span>Meet all customers</span>
          <svg
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
            width='1024'
            height='1024'
            viewBox='0 0 1024 1024'
            class='size-4'
            ><path
              fill='currentColor'
              d='M754.752 480H160a32 32 0 1 0 0 64h594.752L521.344 777.344a32 32 0 0 0 45.312 45.312l288-288a32 32 0 0 0 0-45.312l-288-288a32 32 0 1 0-45.312 45.312z'
            ></path></svg
          >
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
